From: OpenMandriva <packager@openmandriva.org>
Subject: [PATCH] Bug 2054387 - Qt: modal/compose, theme, tooltips, and geometry stabilization

Toolkit-only (widget/qt). Safe to port to Firefox cairo-qt builds.

- Dialogs: SW present, sane mins, WindowModal, clear TransparentForInput on Enable
- Secondary top-levels (compose): SW present after first exclusive-EGL window
- Activation: yield to other activatable windows; skip reclaim for tooltips
- Geometry: +/-1 device-pixel deadband on resize/move under HiDPI
- Mouse: set mButtons (and pressure) for correct click synthesis
- LookAndFeel: system tip palette pairing for InfoBackground/InfoText
- Native theme: checkbox/radio/tooltip via Theme; fix paint device/user coords


